WEBVTT

00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:09.612
This video shows the school setup wizard on your phone. It walks you through setting up a school, one step at a time, and you can leave at any moment.

00:00:11.281 --> 00:00:18.625
Tap the menu button at the top left, and then choose School Setup. The wizard opens on its first step.

00:00:21.424 --> 00:00:34.312
The line under the title shows which step you are on, and a bar shows how much of the setup is done. The first step is the School Profile. The wizard goes on in order, up to a final review.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:44.092
When you have finished a step, tap Next Step at the bottom. The wizard moves on to the next step, which here is Academic Year and Terms.

00:00:47.984 --> 00:00:55.808
If you are not ready for a step, tap Skip to leave it for later. The wizard moves on without changing anything.

00:01:00.557 --> 00:01:06.365
You can tap Exit Setup at the top at any time, and you can come back later to carry on.

00:01:07.337 --> 00:01:14.081
That is the setup wizard. On the last step you review everything and tap Go to Dashboard.
